                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/272.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Bryan to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-08-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The King of Portugal proposes naming a commission to study opium question. Later
                    on the joint high commissioners will be named.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
